{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.MarkovTraceInterleavedCrossTerm"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.crossTerm_eq_closures","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.crossTerm_eq_closures","kind":"theorem","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/InterleavedWordClosures.lean#L69-L77","doc":"**The cross term is a difference of two link invariants of two different links**:\n`Δ = z²·tr(σ³) − z·tr(σ²)²`, trefoil minus Hopf-chain. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.sequential_eq_stab_sq_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.sequential_eq_stab_sq_sq","kind":"theorem","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/InterleavedWordClosures.lean#L62-L67","doc":"**The sequential word is a stabilised product of two `σ²`.**\n`tr(g₀² g₁² g₂) = z · tr(g₀²)²` — its closure is the three-component chain of two Hopf links. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.interleaved_eq_stab_sq_cube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.interleaved_eq_stab_sq_cube","kind":"theorem","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/InterleavedWordClosures.lean#L54-L60","doc":"**The interleaved word is a doubly-stabilised `σ³`.**\n`tr(g₀ g₁ g₀ g₂ g₁) = z² · tr(g₀³)` — its closure is the trefoil. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.tr_g0_cube","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.MathlibExt.InterleavedWordClosures.tr_g0_cube","kind":"theorem","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/MathlibExt/InterleavedWordClosures.lean#L45-L52","doc":"`tr(g₀³) = h·(hz+1) + z`: one Hecke reduction on `g₀ · g₀²`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}